      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community was designed as low‑cost housing with ground‑rent rather than ownership, a unique model for the era.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maryland_City%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Maryland City sits right next to the sprawling Fort Meade army base, sharing a long border on its eastern side.",
