      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maryland_City%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A newer neighborhood called Russett, built in the mid‑1990s, occupies the north side of Maryland Route 198 within the CDP.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
