      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maryland_City%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Firefighters from MCVFD Station 27, stationed at 3498 Laurel Fort Meade Road, patrol the area around Maryland City.",
